AIFlow modifications, 2026-10-06:
- Vendor only neural model, pose detection, resize and tensor helpers.
- Remove human parser, segmentation/mask pipeline and implicit weight download.
- Replace checkpoint loader with local safetensors-only loading.
- Keep grayscale pose drawing only; remove colorful drawing/matplotlib dependency.
- Dedicated flat-lay, segmentation-free pipeline under vton_worker/pipeline.py.
- Preserve full native 576x864 output canvas without upstream unpadding.
No fashn-human-parser source or NVIDIA SegFormer weights are included.
